# ==============================================================================
# Aeroponics Lean — Mosquitto Access Control List (ACL)
# ==============================================================================

# Gateway credentials are per-device identities.  The provisioned MQTT username,
# MQTT client ID and device_id must be the same safe identifier.  `%u` binds the
# topic namespace to the authenticated username, preventing cross-gateway I/O.
pattern readwrite aeroponics/device/%u/#
# Legacy generic command namespace is retained for backwards-compatible
# gateways; new backend publishes use the device-scoped namespace above.
pattern read  aeroponics/command/node/+/override

# Aeroponics Backend Service (Full tenant scope)
user aero_backend
topic readwrite aeroponics/#

# Admin (debug)
user mqtt_admin
topic readwrite #
